#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use Qiskit Serverless to run quantum-classical workloads across the cloud and on quantum-centric supercomputers."
msgstr "Gunakan Qiskit Serverless untuk menjalankan beban kerja kuantum-klasik merentas awan dan pada komputer super berpusatkan kuantum."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to Qiskit Serverless"
msgstr "Pengenalan kepada Qiskit Serverless"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to Qiskit Serverless {#introduction-to-qiskit-serverless}"
msgstr "Pengenalan kepada Qiskit Serverless {#introduction-to-qiskit-serverless}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Serverless provides a simple interface to run workloads across quantum-classical resources. This includes deploying programs to the IBM Quantum&reg; Platform and running workloads remotely, as well as easy resource management for multi-cloud and quantum-centric supercomputing use cases.\n"
msgstr "Qiskit Serverless menyediakan antara muka mudah untuk menjalankan beban kerja merentas sumber kuantum-klasik. Ini termasuk menyebarkan program ke IBM Quantum&reg; Platform dan menjalankan beban kerja dari jauh, serta pengurusan sumber yang mudah untuk kes penggunaan berbilang awan dan pengkomputeran super berpusatkan kuantum.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Premium users can build, deploy, and run their workloads remotely on classical compute made available through IBM Quantum Platform.\n"
msgstr "Pengguna premium boleh membina, menyebarkan, dan menjalankan beban kerja mereka dari jauh pada pengkomputeran klasik yang disediakan melalui IBM Quantum Platform.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"**Qiskit Serverless is getting an upgrade, and its features are changing fast.** During this development phase, find release notes and the most recent documentation at the [Qiskit Serverless GitHub](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/index.html) page.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"**Qiskit Serverless sedang menerima naik taraf, dan ciri-cirinya berubah dengan cepat.** Semasa fasa pembangunan ini, dapatkan nota keluaran dan dokumentasi terkini di halaman [Qiskit Serverless GitHub](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/index.html).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"This is an experimental feature available only for IBM Quantum Premium Plan, Flex Plan, and On-Prem (via IBM Quantum Platform API) Plan users.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Ini adalah ciri eksperimental yang hanya tersedia untuk pengguna IBM Quantum Premium Plan, Flex Plan, dan On-Prem (melalui IBM Quantum Platform API) Plan.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "When should I use Qiskit Serverless? {#when-should-i-use-qiskit-serverless}"
msgstr "Bilakah saya patut menggunakan Qiskit Serverless? {#when-should-i-use-qiskit-serverless}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Serverless helps manage classical and quantum resources across the entire [Qiskit patterns](/guides/intro-to-patterns) workflow. This includes some of the following examples:\n"
msgstr "Qiskit Serverless membantu mengurus sumber klasik dan kuantum merentasi keseluruhan aliran kerja [corak Qiskit](/guides/intro-to-patterns). Ini termasuk beberapa contoh berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Parallelizing classical tasks, such as pre-processing and post-processing\n"
msgstr "Menyelarikkan tugas klasik, seperti pra-pemprosesan dan pasca-pemprosesan\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Persisting long-running workloads in the cloud, even if your laptop is turned off\n"
msgstr "Mengekalkan beban kerja yang berjalan lama dalam awan, walaupun komputer riba anda dimatikan\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deploying reusable programs\n"
msgstr "Menyebarkan program yang boleh digunakan semula\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "What is included? {#what-is-included}"
msgstr "Apakah yang disertakan? {#what-is-included}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following compute resources are included by default in the Qiskit Serverless environment. Users can contact [support](/guides/support) to increase any of these.\n"
msgstr "Sumber pengkomputeran berikut disertakan secara lalai dalam persekitaran Qiskit Serverless. Pengguna boleh menghubungi [sokongan](/guides/support) untuk meningkatkan mana-mana daripada ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Normal node:** \n"
"- 24 vCPU cores\n"
"- 120GB RAM\n"
"- Maximum of two active jobs per user at any one time\n"
msgstr ""
"**Nod normal:** \n"
"- 24 teras vCPU\n"
"- 120GB RAM\n"
"- Maksimum dua kerja aktif setiap pengguna pada satu masa\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**GPU node** (used by the [Algorithmiq TEM](/guides/algorithmiq-tem) Qiskit Function):\n"
"- 24 vCPU cores\n"
"- 120GB RAM\n"
"- Nvidia L40S GPU\n"
"- Maximum of four active jobs per user at any one time\n"
msgstr ""
"**Nod GPU** (digunakan oleh [Algorithmiq TEM](/guides/algorithmiq-tem) Fungsi Qiskit):\n"
"- 24 teras vCPU\n"
"- 120GB RAM\n"
"- GPU Nvidia L40S\n"
"- Maksimum empat kerja aktif setiap pengguna pada satu masa\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Qiskit Serverless {#install-qiskit-serverless}"
msgstr "Pasang Qiskit Serverless {#install-qiskit-serverless}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To use Qiskit Serverless on IBM Quantum Platform, install the following packages:\n"
msgstr "Untuk menggunakan Qiskit Serverless di IBM Quantum Platform, pasang pakej berikut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`qiskit_ibm_catalog` provides the client-side tools to upload and run remote programs, while `qiskit_serverless` provides server-side tools to distribute compute and manage data. These packages require `python` 3.11+. For users and organizations who want to run Qiskit Serverless on custom infrastructure, follow the [Cloud infrastructure setup](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/) guide.\n"
msgstr "`qiskit_ibm_catalog` menyediakan alat sisi klien untuk memuat naik dan menjalankan program jauh, manakala `qiskit_serverless` menyediakan alat sisi pelayan untuk mengedarkan pengkomputeran dan mengurus data. Pakej-pakej ini memerlukan `python` 3.11+. Bagi pengguna dan organisasi yang ingin menjalankan Qiskit Serverless pada infrastruktur tersuai, ikuti panduan [Persediaan infrastruktur awan](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
#| "Currently, the IBM Quantum workloads table only reflects Qiskit Runtime workloads. Use `job.status()` to see your Qiskit Serverless workload's current status. Find an example in the [Run your first Qiskit Serverless workload remotely](/guides/serverless-run-first-workload#serverless-job-status) guide.\n"
#| "</Admonition>\n"
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"Currently, the IBM Quantum workloads table only reflects IBM Quantum Compute Service workloads. Use `job.status()` to see your Qiskit Serverless workload's current status. Find an example in the [Run your first Qiskit Serverless workload remotely](/guides/serverless-run-first-workload#serverless-job-status) guide.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"Pada masa ini, jadual beban kerja IBM Quantum hanya mencerminkan beban kerja Qiskit Runtime. Gunakan `job.status()` untuk melihat status semasa beban kerja Qiskit Serverless anda. Cari contoh dalam panduan [Jalankan beban kerja Qiskit Serverless pertama anda dari jauh](/guides/serverless-run-first-workload#serverless-job-status).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

